      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.05,
          "end": 3.42,
          "en": "Modern smartphones",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.42,
          "end": 6.39,
          "en": "often have notches like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.39,
          "end": 8.53,
          "en": "Here it's the typical iPhone notch,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 8.53,
          "end": 10.44,
          "en": "other devices have a smaller notch,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 10.44,
          "end": 13.39,
          "en": "but often we do have notches like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 13.39,
          "end": 15.1,
          "en": "And therefore we wanna add some distance",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 15.1,
          "end": 17.99,
          "en": "to make sure that our content isn't too close",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 17.99,
          "end": 20.033,
          "en": "or even under that notch.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 20.91,
          "end": 24.05,
          "en": "But, of course, not all smartphones have such a notch,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 24.05,
          "end": 27.41,
          "en": "and it's not the same size for all smartphones.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 27.41,
          "end": 31.08,
          "en": "Therefore it would be nice if there would be some component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 31.08,
          "end": 33.54,
          "en": "that would automatically detect",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 33.54,
          "end": 35.41,
          "en": "on which device we're running",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 35.41,
          "end": 38.18,
          "en": "and add an appropriate amount of spacing",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 38.18,
          "end": 41.47,
          "en": "around our content to allow for that notch",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 41.47,
          "end": 43.8,
          "en": "and for that status bar.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 43.8,
          "end": 48.57,
          "en": "And it turns out that such a component, thankfully, exists",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 48.57,
          "end": 51.51,
          "en": "and it's even built into React Native.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 51.51,
          "end": 53.803,
          "en": "It's the safe area view.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 55,
          "end": 58.46,
          "en": "And actually I wanna wrap this view around all my screens,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 58.46,
          "end": 60.61,
          "en": "not just around the game screen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 60.61,
          "end": 63.22,
          "en": "Therefore I will not import it in the game screen,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 63.22,
          "end": 65.23,
          "en": "but instead in app JS",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 65.23,
          "end": 67.21,
          "en": "because there I wanna wrap it around",
          "zh": ""
