          "en": "It should be below the notch instead.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 95.62,
          "end": 98.22,
          "en": "So that's fine, but I do want to make sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 98.22,
          "end": 100.64,
          "en": "that my main content, my screen content,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
